Stage 4 Design
What it does
A single natural language prompt generates a complete ExecutionGraph which the existing GraphRuntime executes.
"Show Chennai customers and their total orders"
        ↓
Intent Engine (LLM)
        ↓
ExecutionGraph {
  nodes: [fetchCustomers, fetchOrders, merge, format],
  edges: [...]
}
        ↓
GraphRuntime.execute(graph)
        ↓
Result
The LLM's job is narrow — produce a valid graph JSON. The runtime handles everything else. This is the same pattern as Stage 1 where the LLM produces a QueryPlan JSON and the compiler handles execution.

