## The Flow
```
IntentEngine.execute(prompt, context)
        ↓
1. Build system prompt with schema + node library catalogue
        ↓
2. LLM generates ExecutionGraph JSON
        ↓
3. validateGraph(graph)         ← existing function
   if invalid → self-correct up to 3 times (same pattern as QueryPlan)
        ↓
4. GraphRuntime.execute(graph)  ← existing runtime
        ↓
5. Return IntentResult
```

**The self-correction loop is already proven** — we built it in Stage 1 for `QueryPlan`. Stage 4 applies the same pattern to `ExecutionGraph`.

